OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCold and windy across the north
OL,6,Fwith persistent rain for most, except
OL,7,Ffor the far north of Scotland which
OL,8,Fwill be bright with light showers.
OL,9,FWindy and showery across Wales and the
OL,10,Fsouth, but milder there with
OL,11,Foccasional sunny spells.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FFurther rain across the north
OL,14,Fthough mostly dry for the far north of
OL,15,FScotland. Scattered, heavy showers
OL,16,Fcontinue in the south. Winds easing,
OL,17,Fbut remaining strong along southern
OL,18,Fcoasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
