OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FSimilar tomorrow, being
OL,6,Fbright and dry for northern Scotland,
OL,7,Fcold with patchy rain elsewhere in the
OL,8,Fnorth, and milder with sunny spells
OL,9,Fand scattered heavy showers across the
OL,10,Fsouth.
